  "title": "`fcntl(2)` `F_DUPFD`/`F_DUPFD_CLOEXEC`：`dup_fd` 将 `min_fd` 经 `c_int` 截断再传入 `add_file_like_at_least`，超大 `arg` 可错误落成小 `startfd`",
  "status": "resolved",
